herdr-app
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, at b721deda985270ec8256552692729a4add389b2a
License: Apache-2.0 (full text in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)

Adapted here, and changed:
- ghostty-sys/build.rs and ghostty-sys/src/lib.rs, from crates/ghostty-sys: the
  Ghostty source path points at vendor/ghostty.
- terminal/src/vt.rs, from src/vt.rs: cut to the screen, cursor, scrollback, colours,
  selection, hyperlinks and the key, mouse and focus encoders; search and images are
  left out; frames are read as rows of cells for Rune to draw.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ghostty's renderer, ported
https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty, at the pinned submodule above
License: MIT (above)

Ported to Rust, and changed:
- terminal/src/sprite.rs, from src/font/sprite/draw: box drawing, blocks, braille and
  powerline glyphs drawn to the cell.
- terminal/src/paint.rs, from src/font/sprite/draw/special.zig and the text shader's
  linear-corrected blending: underline styles, strikethrough, overline and the cursor.
- terminal/src/font.rs, from src/font/Metrics.zig and src/font/Collection.zig: the cell's
  metrics and the size a fallback face is drawn at.

